lines:
这里到处是火山灰，
呼呼！{be01}
我有个特别的才能，
呼呼，{be01}
我能用火山灰制作玻
璃，呼呼。{be01}
用这个去收集火山灰
吧，呼呼。

Hmmm...
There’s not enough ash here, huff-puff.{be00}
I can’t make glass with this, huff-puff.{be01}
Let’s see... {0100:1} is the number of steps
you’ll need to walk for me to make you{be00}
a Blue Flute, huff-puff.

A {0100:1}, huff-puff?{be01}
There’s not enough ash here to make
that, though, huff-puff.{be01}
Let’s see... {0100:2} is the number of steps
you’ll need to walk through volcanic ash{be00}
for me to make that item, huff-puff.{be01}
Which item would you rather have me
make instead, huff-puff?
